<title>USA: AGTsports names Crews president.</title>
<headline>AGTsports names Crews president.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER, Colo. 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>AGTsports Inc said on Monday it had named Gary Crews president under the terms of a five year employment agreement.</p>
<p>The company said Crews has previously served as President of XETA Reservations and as vice president of Fairway Systems in the golf tee time reservation industry.</p>
